<section class="k-card p-5" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
  <h2 id="privacy-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Privacy-first by default</h2>
  <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700 md:grid-cols-3">
    <p><strong class="text-slate-900">Local templates stay local.</strong> Class templates are saved in this teacher browser unless you export them.</p>
    <p><strong class="text-slate-900">Live sessions are temporary.</strong> Live mode sends only the session state needed by the display and expires automatically.</p>
    <p><strong class="text-slate-900">Display links are read-only.</strong> Teacher write capabilities are never included in display payloads or exported JSON.</p>
  </div>
</section>
